/Creator ( )
/Producer ( )
/Author ()
/Keywords (*ARMY OPERATIONS;MAINTENANCE;AERIAL RECONNAISSANCE;MILITARY INTELLIGENCE;DETECTORS;ARMY TRAINING;CLOSE SUPPORT;TACTICAL AIR SUPPORT;LOGISTICS;CASUALTIES;RELEASE MECHANISMS;JUNGLES;VEHICLES;PSYCHOLOGICAL WARFARE;ARTILLERY;VIETNAM;HERBICIDES;AIRMOBILE OPERATIONS;MEDICAL SUPPLIES;COUNTERINSURGENCY)
/Subject (During the reporting period the 1st Cav Div AM continued operations throughout the TAOI to interdict enemy infiltration routes through Tay Ninh, Phuoc Long, Binh Long, Binh Duong, and Bien Hoa Provinces in order to deny enemy access to the population centers, and to neutralize enemy forces operating throughout the area. Division elements continued to support the GVN Pacification Program and conducted Dong Tien operations with RVNAF forces operating with the Division TAOI.)
/Title (Lessons Learned, Headquarters, 1st Cavalry Division)
/Filename (/pdf/TR/AD0512505.pdf)
>>
